Package: icetools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Managing Initial Conditions for Quantitative Trade Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Julian", "Hinz", email = "mail@julianhinz.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Create, read, validate, and manage .ice files (portable initial
    conditions for quantitative trade models: per-table CSVs plus YAML
    metadata in a tar archive) and .icc files (compiled initial conditions:
    the long-table to dense-array cast done once and serialized for fast
    model setup). Includes metadata handling, table validation, checksums,
    and archive manifests. The format reference lives at <https://icefil.es>.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    yaml,
    utils,
    cli,
    tools,
    data.table,
    digest
Suggests:
    qs2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://icefil.es, https://github.com/julianhinz/icetools
BugReports: https://github.com/julianhinz/icetools/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
